  "body": "### Added\r\n\r\n- Allow opening failed workflows\r\n- Add command for generating act3's config\r\n- Add command for validating act3's config\r\n\r\n### Changed\r\n\r\n- Changed CLI interface to use dual flags (-g/--global)\r\n- Improve HTML layout\r\n- Allow fetching results for multiple repos\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Changelog\r\n* 308289096cf2e0772c2449652294b8ffb878cc78 add links to act3-runner\r\n* d5757300e17ee5b0daa32bbb4f757fad374c91b2 update README for v2.0.0\r\n* eb57ab2e6815d63dc32261850ef22993707f4e55 update badges\r\n* 4e8f4472bd504690ded496ea21bba46077bd9771 update changelog for v2.0.0\r\n* 232be220308f0ca7e46b207a625cb2ee481fc3b0 use released version for docs\r\n\r\n"
